    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/7e22930ff13c63eac858d2db2608878d.poster.avif?t=1728841053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/7e22930ff13c63eac858d2db2608878d.webm?t=1728841053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/7e22930ff13c63eac858d2db2608878d.mp4?t=1728841053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>How long is your Slurpie worm?</strong> Relax in this <i>FREE</i> version of the multiplayer arcade game and control a colorful space snake with your hand. <br><br>Chill out with your friends while collecting as much food as possible. The more you eat, the more the snake grows. Try not to run into other players or all kinds of playful baddies! With a calming Zen mode, multiplayer modifiers, and over 18 solo maps, there is a game mode for everyone to enjoy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Snake, slither, SLURRPP!</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/80dd3e78b36c53c133330f3a55be7ad9.poster.avif?t=1728841053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/80dd3e78b36c53c133330f3a55be7ad9.webm?t=1728841053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/80dd3e78b36c53c133330f3a55be7ad9.mp4?t=1728841053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Players control a snake that follows your hand<br></li><li>It grows in length as you eat food<br></li><li>Evolve and cover yourself in armor as it grows<br></li><li>Survive the longest without colliding with yourself or other players<br></li><li>Competitive players can sabotage each other to win the game<br></li><li>Avoid the Jazzeroids and other enemy obstacles on your quest to be the longest slurp!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/9ef5a48a0a51437b90bb5be769effafa.poster.avif?t=1728841053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/9ef5a48a0a51437b90bb5be769effafa.webm?t=1728841053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/9ef5a48a0a51437b90bb5be769effafa.mp4?t=1728841053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy over 18 unique and vibrant maps<br></li><li>Cross platform multiplayer, both matchmaking and games with friends<br></li><li>Multiplayer compatible with the original paid game Space Slurpies<br></li><li>Customize your snake and make uniquely yours</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SLUUUUUUUUUUURRP &amp; Grow</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/7e22930ff13c63eac858d2db2608878d.poster.avif?t=1728841053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/7e22930ff13c63eac858d2db2608878d.webm?t=1728841053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/7e22930ff13c63eac858d2db2608878d.mp4?t=1728841053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>How long is your Slurpie worm?</strong> Relax in this <i>FREE</i> version of the multiplayer arcade game and control a colorful space snake with your hand. <br><br>Chill out with your friends while collecting as much food as possible. The more you eat, the more the snake grows. Try not to run into other players or all kinds of playful baddies! With a calming Zen mode, multiplayer modifiers, and over 18 solo maps, there is a game mode for everyone to enjoy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Snake, slither, SLURRPP!</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/80dd3e78b36c53c133330f3a55be7ad9.poster.avif?t=1728841053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/80dd3e78b36c53c133330f3a55be7ad9.webm?t=1728841053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/80dd3e78b36c53c133330f3a55be7ad9.mp4?t=1728841053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Players control a snake that follows your hand<br></li><li>It grows in length as you eat food<br></li><li>Evolve and cover yourself in armor as it grows<br></li><li>Survive the longest without colliding with yourself or other players<br></li><li>Competitive players can sabotage each other to win the game<br></li><li>Avoid the Jazzeroids and other enemy obstacles on your quest to be the longest slurp!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/9ef5a48a0a51437b90bb5be769effafa.poster.avif?t=1728841053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/9ef5a48a0a51437b90bb5be769effafa.webm?t=1728841053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119160/extras/9ef5a48a0a51437b90bb5be769effafa.mp4?t=1728841053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy over 18 unique and vibrant maps<br></li><li>Cross platform multiplayer, both matchmaking and games with friends<br></li><li>Multiplayer compatible with the original paid game Space Slurpies<br></li><li>Customize your snake and make uniquely yours</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SLUUUUUUUUUUURRP &amp; Grow</h2>",
    "short_description": "Snake, slither, SLURRPP! Chill out with your friends in this free multiplayer arcade game. Relax as you grow your colorful space snake by eating lots of food and avoiding playful baddies and other players. How long can you grow your Space Slurpie?",
